    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A competitive puzzle-arcade fighting game where you stack colored blocks and detonate them using matching bombs. Chain together devastating combos and dominate the leaderboards! Play through an intense single-player campaign, challenge your friends online, and fight your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack blocks into clusters and clear them with bombs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match colors to build clusters, then detonate them with bombs of the same color to trigger explosive reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up chains for even bigger combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bombs strategically in advance to trigger chain reactions. The longer the chain, the higher your bonus\u2014and the stronger your attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create connections across the board!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link blocks of same color to the edges of the board. Each connected path adds to your score and your attack power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash the powerful ring combo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surround one cluster with another to activate the ring effect\u2014each enclosed cluster boosts your score even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack, link, and chain together the ultimate combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine chains, rings, and lines for maximum impact\u2014rack up insane points and overwhelm your opponents with crushing attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A competitive puzzle-arcade fighting game where you stack colored blocks and detonate them using matching bombs. Chain together devastating combos and dominate the leaderboards! Play through an intense single-player campaign, challenge your friends online, and fight your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack blocks into clusters and clear them with bombs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match colors to build clusters, then detonate them with bombs of the same color to trigger explosive reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/f759722eb80ec82112a47fa0a0d4167f.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up chains for even bigger combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bombs strategically in advance to trigger chain reactions. The longer the chain, the higher your bonus\u2014and the stronger your attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/d9b394e6b4623bb50d742b1b27699863.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create connections across the board!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link blocks of same color to the edges of the board. Each connected path adds to your score and your attack power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/709c606128c90ac14131efb2c308b5f0.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash the powerful ring combo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surround one cluster with another to activate the ring effect\u2014each enclosed cluster boosts your score even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.poster.avif?t=1740671009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.webm?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747930/extras/cf7cb90eae694790f8050cc7ff0ac4fd.mp4?t=1740671009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack, link, and chain together the ultimate combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine chains, rings, and lines for maximum impact\u2014rack up insane points and overwhelm your opponents with crushing attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
